        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Opéra-Comique, Paris\n- People: Daniel Auber, a leading tenor\n- Works: an opera premiere, Les Rendezvous\n- Topics: performance history, music composition\n\nFacts:\n- In 1846, a work was first performed at the Opéra-Comique in Paris with a leading tenor.\n- The leading tenor sang in the premiere of an opera featuring music by Daniel Auber.\n- Daniel Auber had previously contributed to the one-act ballet Les Rendezvous in 1933.",
